# Sample tky2jgd.par format data
# Format: MeshCode Lat Lon dB(sec) dL(sec) dH(m)
# This is a simplified sample for demonstration purposes
# 
# Real tky2jgd.par data can be obtained from:
# https://vldb.gsi.go.jp/sokuchi/surveycalc/tky2jgd/download/
#
# MeshCode: Third mesh code (1km mesh)
# Lat: Latitude in degrees
# Lon: Longitude in degrees  
# dB: Latitude shift in arcseconds (Tokyo -> JGD)
# dL: Longitude shift in arcseconds (Tokyo -> JGD)
# dH: Height shift in meters (Tokyo -> JGD)

